      <p>We may use your information to:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Process and manage your orders.</li>
        <li>Arrange delivery of purchased products.</li>
        <li>Communicate with you about your order.</li>
        <li>Respond to customer inquiries.</li>
        <li>Process returns, exchanges and refunds.</li>
        <li>Improve our website, products and customer service.</li>
        <li>Prevent fraudulent or unauthorized activities.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
