      <p>
        Online payments may be processed through third-party payment service
        providers.
      </p>

      <p>
        MG DREAM ZONE does not intentionally store complete card details such
        as full card numbers or CVV information on our website.
      </p>

      <p>
        Payment information may be handled directly by the relevant payment
        provider according to its own terms and privacy practices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Sharing Information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or rent customers' personal information.
      </p>

      <p>
        We may share necessary information with trusted service providers
        when required to complete your order, such as delivery or payment
        service providers.
      </p>

      <p>
        Information may also be disclosed where required by applicable law
        or by a lawful request from an authorized authority.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Delivery Information</h2>
      <p>
        To deliver your order, we may need to provide the customer's name,
        telephone number and delivery address to the relevant delivery or
        courier service.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Cookies & Website Data</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use basic cookies, browser storage or similar
        technologies to improve website functionality and user experience.
      </p>

      <p>
        These technologies may help remember preferences, maintain website
        functionality or understand how visitors use the website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect customer information against
        unauthorized access, misuse, alteration or disclosure.
      </p>

      <p>
        However, no method of transmitting or storing information online can
        be guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use third-party services for functions such as
        payments, hosting, analytics, delivery or other website services.
      </p>

      <p>
        These third parties may process information according to their own
        privacy policies and terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is intended for general customers and is not specifically
        directed at children. We do not knowingly collect personal information
        from children for purposes unrelated to providing our services.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>10. Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about the personal information we hold about
        you, or if you believe your information needs to be corrected, please
        contact MG DREAM ZONE through the contact information provided on our
        website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        MG DREAM ZONE may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
        Changes will be published on this page together with the updated
        date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how your
        information is handled, please contact MG DREAM ZONE through the
        contact details available on our website.
      </p>
    </section>

